BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Trans Youth Socials: Vogue Dancing Workshop
DTSTART:20260424T180000
DTEND:20260424T180000
UID:122d8a478fb563455dc14a80aa6ba5a9@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:The 519 Trans Youth Mentorship Program (TYMP) invites 2 Spirit
 \, trans\, non-binary\, and gender-diverse youth (ages 16 to 29) to the ne
 xt TYMP Social on Friday\, April 24\, 6 to 8 p.m. at The 519. Take part in
  a vogue dancing workshop facilitated by Lavender Reilly from Toronto Kiki
  Ballroom Alliance! Explore an iconic community dance form\, meet peers an
 d friends\, and receive community referrals. The workshop is open to all s
 kill levels but tailored to beginners. The event is free and TTC Tickets w
 ill be provided. RSVP preferred. Visit The519.org/programs/trans-youth-soc
 ials/. Website link in bio. [Image description: A person voguing on the da
 nce floor. They are squatting with their hands in the air as a large audie
 nce surrounds and cheers them. Text reads: “Trans Youth Socials: Vogue D
 ancing Workshop. Friday\, April 24\, 6 to 8 p.m. at The 519. RSVP preferre
 d.”] ‍
LOCATION:The 519 Community Centre\, 519 Church Street
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/trans-youth-socials-vogue-dancing-workshop
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
