BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hutch &amp\; Friends
DTSTART:20260424T210000
DTEND:20260424T210000
UID:dbe33bcd238bddacf9038d4925a029a2@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Courtney Gilmour is an award-winning comedian and television w
 riter. In 2017 she delivered a breakout performance at the Just For Laughs
  Festival in Montreal by becoming the first female to win the prestigious 
 Homegrown Comics Competition as Canada’s top comedian. Courtney has been
  featured on multiple national broadcasts from festivals including the Win
 nipeg Comedy Festival\, Halifax Comedy Festival\, Just For Laughs Vancouve
 r as well as Kevin Hart’s LOL Network and The Howie Mandel All Stars Gal
 a at Just For Laughs Montreal. Elaine Gold is a comedian and storyteller. 
 She was a featured storyteller on Tinder Tales for 5 years\, performing on
  storytelling stages all over Toronto and Ontario. Elaine loves to honestl
 y tell her hilarious life stories. She&#x27\;s old AF and loves playing th
 e old lady card. Her last appearance at a Hutch show she had the audience 
 howling with laughter. Tom Henry is a comedian\, actor and writer from Tor
 onto. His acclaimed Just for Laughs produced Stand Up Special\, ‘66 Joke
 s’\, can be found on Crave TV. He&#x27\;s appeared at festivals such as 
 Just For Laughs\, San Francisco Sketchfest and Bridgetown Comedy Festival\
 , and has opened for comics such as Nate Bargatze\, Nikki Glaser and Tim M
 eadows. He was nominated for a Canadian Comedy Award for Best Stand-Up New
 comer in 2012. His album\, ‘Tom Henry Kills’ reached number one on the
  iTunes comedy charts. Chris Robinson is one of the premier comics in Cana
 da. In 2016 he was the runner-up at the prestigious homegrown competition 
 at Just For Laughs in Montreal. Later that year he was crowned Sirius XM&#
 x27\;s Top Comic. A win that granted him $25\,000--and a return to Just Fo
 r Laughs Montreal\, an appearance at JFL Northwest in Vancouver and his so
 lo show at JFL42 in 2017. Chris is a working actor on Netflix\, Amazon\, C
 MT\, and various TV and internet commercials. Now Magazine has described h
 im as having &quot\;charisma and raw talent to burn.&quot\; Catch this ris
 ing star live and you will not be disappointed. Host Paul Hutcheson is a q
 ueer comedic performer\, writer and producer. His six solo shows have been
  produced numerous comedic solo shows which have toured Canada and the Uni
 ted States\, playing to sold-out audiences\, glowing reviews and awards. H
 e produces monthly comedy events Hutch &amp\; Friends and Hutch’s Storyt
 ime in Toronto. He can be seen on various comedy and storytelling stages i
 n Toronto. His comedy album\, Call Me Hutch\, his first comedy recording\,
  is produced by Howl &amp\; Roar Records. Please visit canuckhutch.com for
  more information. &quot\;Comparable to Jim Carey\, only not obnoxious.&qu
 ot\; -CBC @canuckhutch / canuckhutch.com ‍
LOCATION:Burdock Music Hall\, 1184 Bloor St W
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/hutch-friends
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
