BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tawoos Presents: Queer Bollywood
DTSTART:20260424T220000
DTEND:20260424T220000
UID:8d2092f96a261e3e7d5d110b50afc709@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Back by popular demand\, a night of grooving on the dance floo
 r\, showing off our best fits\, and going open to close with hits from acr
 oss the subcontinent featuring two of Toronto&#x27\;s most iconic Queer DJ
 s! DJ Amita is a legend in the Queer Toronto music scene\, as a director\,
  producer and the founder and resident DJ of Besharam for the past 15 year
 s\, Canada&#x27\;s longest running and largest Bollywood club parties. Her
  DJing has roots in Desh Pardesh\, women&#x27\;s and LGBTQ communities and
  she strives to always create an inclusive dance floor space for all those
  who shamelessly love Bollywood music. Heebiejabi is a Queer Afghan DJ bas
 ed in Toronto. Driven by a passion for cultivating revolutionary love and 
 community\, her sound is open format\, effortlessly intertwining rhythms a
 nd genres from across the SWANA region with global club sounds. She crafts
  high-energy\, borderless journeys that are both educational and irresisti
 bly danceable by weaving together traditional sounds with modern electroni
 c beats. Every set is an invitation to connect\, move\, and celebrate the 
 spirit of togetherness\, where diverse sounds seamlessly blend into one po
 werful\, unifying vibe. ‍
LOCATION:BSMT 254\, 254 Lansdowne Avenue
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/tawoos-presents-queer-bollywood
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Daniel Avery and Vjollça
DTSTART:20260424T220000
DTEND:20260424T220000
UID:32e94ba8bdfcc30c987a280621692b6d@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Standard Time welcomes the return of Daniel Avery alongside Vj
 ollça! At what point does a record end and an altered state of mind begin
 ? Where does all that caustic noise and ecstatic melody that’s been pres
 sed in a record’s grooves begin to cognitively shift your perceptions an
 d help lift you out of the mundane into a space to inhabit\, an escape fro
 m the world outside? Following all that sound will bring you to Tremor –
  the breathtaking sixth album by Daniel Avery. An inner world built from c
 haotic noise\, transcendental ambience and voices that echo around it like
  pulsing transmissions from some distant ether world. All those sounds on 
 Tremor sublimely flow and blur together to leave the listener disconnected
  from the here and now. It’s as close to magic as music can get. (FOR MO
 RE INFO SEE TICKET LINK PROVIDED)
LOCATION:Standard Time\, 165 Geary Avenue #2nd Floor Unit A
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/daniel-avery-and-vjollca
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
