 loor as her God-given right. GURAFIKU brings bold and vibrant energy to he
 r craft. Drawing deeply from her Afro-Caribbean heritage\, she fuses globa
 l rhythms such as Amapiano\, Konpa\, Zouk\, Shatta\, Gqom\, Kuduro\, Baile
