 house—creating a sound uniquely her own. + we are safe in the hands of o
 ur very own local club conductors @litneyworldwide\, @ard1nlove5tar\, @mad
 ame.myles\, @officialkike April 24th @ Sound Machine Toronto\, the playgro
 und will be yours. PLURR (peace\, love\, unity\, respect &amp\; responsibi
 lity) always. Wear deodorant with aluminum in it pls &amp\; if you like to
  steal phones\, I dare you to pull up too !! Wicked poster illustration cr
 eated by @shyfuck ‍
