  contemporary fashion design. &#x27\;Always in Fashion&#x27\; is an exhibi
 tion that highlights Indigenous designers reclaiming cultural narratives\,
  challenging colonial frameworks\, and addressing internal community tensi
 ons around appropriation. It’s a look at how Indigenous couturiers are r
 eshaping the industry and redefining fashion on their own terms\, while re
 cognizing that they have always been the blueprint. ‍
