BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Moxie\, Kiki LeFreak\, Karim Olen Ash and Phillippe presented by N
 UNU x Standard Time
DTSTART:20260501T210000
DTEND:20260501T210000
UID:cf88956b02541a1e0653935f097d9235@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:/lineup Moxie Kiki LeFreak Karim Olen Ash Phillippe Standard T
 ime and NUNU come together to present NTS royalty and international house 
 music DJ diva Moxie for a night of wild dancing that will leave breathless
 . Toronto’s own Kiki LeFreak\, Karim Olen Ash and Phillippe will be roun
 ding out this ultra special night. Moxie is a dance music powerhouse who b
 roadcasts her iconic voice as one of London’s most in-demand DJs and rad
 io hosts\, continuing to be a constant fixture of clubs and festivals glob
 ally. NTS Radio is Moxie’s weekly home on Wednesdays. For 13 years now s
 he has maintained one of the longest standing residencies on the internet 
 radio behemoth\, where her iconic voice accompanies the very best in deep 
 house\, Detroit techno and just about anything dubby\, groovy and percussi
 ve that’s bursting with soul. Moxie often invites guests\, with past fea
 tures including Jeff Mills\, Steve Spacek\, DJ Holographic\, Four Tet\, Or
 :la &amp\; more. When not hosting radio\, Moxie tours globally as one of t
 he circuits much loved DJs. She touches down regularly in Panorama Bar\, G
 lastonbury\, Rainbow Disco Club\, Bassiani\, KOKO\, Le Sucre\,Love Interna
 tional\, Houghton\, Draaimolen\, De School and Sonar BCN and has produced 
 celebrated mixes for Resident Advisor\, BBC 1’s Essential Mix\, Beats In
  Space\, Truants\, FACT\, Solid Steel\, Triple J and more. Further to this
  is Moxie’s renowned work as a party coordinator\, label owner and voice
 over artist. She founded On Loop in 2016\, which as a label has released b
 eloved music from producers across the globe such as Shanti Celeste\, Dese
 rt Sound Colony\, Matisa\, Nicola Cruz and Yu Su while as a party hosted p
 acked events in most clubbing institutions across Britain and Europe. Then
  there is Moxie&#x27\;s celebrated voiceover work\, most noted in her comm
 entary for Resident Advisor’s Narrated Shorts Film series covering dance
  music legends Drexciya\, Burial and Jai Paul while also on their What Hap
 pened To Tech House?’ mini-documentary. All of the above illustrates Mox
 ie’s multidisciplinary practice in dance music\, best highlighted by her
  tireless work ethic in her own career\, while simultaneously uplifting ar
 tists and DJs in her orbit at any chance she gets. ‍
LOCATION:Standard Time\, 165 Geary Avenue #2nd Floor Unit A
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/moxie-kiki-lefreak-karim-olen-ash-and-phil
 lippe-presented-by-nunu-x-standard-time
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
