 -editors Rahim Thawer and Maryam Khan\, as they launch their new book “Q
 ueer and Muslim”. Talkback guest David Lewis Peart will be in conversati
 on with Rahim and Aaron El Sabrout to celebrate the essays\, poems\, lette
 rs to past and future selves\, and more\, that make up “Queer and Muslim
