 r a night of jaw-dropping stunts\, breathtaking beauty and divine transfem
 ininity that will leave you worshipping on your hands and knees. DOLLS was
  created in response to the lack of representation for trans girls and fem
 mes within trans and gender diverse space in Toronto. So\, these sisters a
 re doing it for themselves! From upcoming icons to true living legends\, t
 hese Devastatingly Opulent Local Ladies Serving will sweep you off your fe
 et and transport you to the magical land of the DOLLS. Prepare yourself fo
 r the upcoming cast reveal and get ready to GAG. ONE NIGHT ONLY - Friday\,
  May 8th at 8:30pm at Cake Cabaret. Doors at 7:30pm. Don&#x27\;t miss your
  chance to Support\, Uplift and Pay the Dolls\, while witnessing their inc
 redible talents at this iconic debut event. Show 8:30\, Door 7:30. 19+ ‍
