DTEND:20260607T150000
UID:d31cef123f90bf7d0913bcda7b5263e4@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Fourth Culture x Tawoos present CLASS OF TAWOOS A celebration 
 of the community that grew out of the Tawoos Drop-In Sessions. For years\,
  the Drop-Ins gave emerging DJs in Toronto’s South Asian creative commun
 ity a place to learn\, experiment\, and connect through open decks and art
 ist workshops. While the sessions came to a close last year\, the communit
 y they built continues to shape the scene. To honour that chapter\, Fourth
  Culture and Tawoos bring together a lineup of DJs who started at the Drop
 -Ins and have since found their place behind dance floors across the city.
  For this special night\, we take over Rhythm\, a home for Toronto’s mus
 ic community. Join us in celebrating the artists\, friendships\, and cultu
 re that grew from those nights. From us\, for all of us. ‍
LOCATION:Rhythm\, 141 Bathurst St
