 me to Palais Royale\, the largest WLW Pride Kickoff in Toronto! We’re ta
 king over a legendary waterfront ballroom and patio and turning it into so
 mething unforgettable for Pride 2026. ✨ 1000+ WLW / Sapphics / NB babes 
 🌊 A two-tiered\, 4\,000 sq ft patio lake side 🎧 6 DJs\, multiple sou
 nds\, something for everyone 🚗 Free onsite parking 🍹 Multiple bars +
  VIP booths and service 🪩 Performers\, talent &amp\; surprises all nigh
 t long A truly iconic Toronto venue thats hosted the biggest bands and leg
 ends\, Palais Royale has been setting the stage for unforgettable nights f
 or over 100 years. Now it’s all ours! 3 Day All Access VIP Pass We have 
 a limited amount of VIP wristbands which will get you into all 3 About Las
 t Night Pride Events and include Linebypass. Reserve yours here: https://w
 ww.eventbrite.ca/e/1987014273180 Music Stage 1 Sounds like: Pop\, House\, 
