 e with dedicated washrooms on the main floor. washrooms via ramp inside th
 e main venue. Please reach out to us if you need support\, and we will coo
 rdinate everything in advance for seamless entry. Photography and Filming 
 Our team of photographers and videographers will be capturing the magic of
  Fantasy Island all night. By attending\, you consent to your image possib
 ly appearing in future event promos. Who this party is for: *Hide and Seek
